      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "昨日フレンドと遊んでて同じ問題に気がついた。これが1年近く放置されてるの信じられない。\n\nI noticed the same issue while playing with a friend yesterday. I can't believe this has been left unaddressed for nearly a year.",
